 "_about": "Adequacy findings that let personal data leave the EU/EEA (GDPR Art. 45) or the UK (UK GDPR Art. 45, 'data bridges') without further safeguards. Statuses: 'adequate' (whole country); 'partial' (only the named sector or organisations); 'conditional_dpf' (only organisations certified under the Data Privacy Framework, which VecShield cannot verify). Anything not listed has no adequacy finding here: a transfer needs an Art. 46 mechanism (SCCs, UK IDTA or Addendum, BCRs) or an Art. 49 derogation. This file records the legal basis; it is not legal advice and it does not establish that any transfer is lawful.",
